			"Message": "docs(Echo): Condense README with problem-first opening\n\nReplace verbose README with concise, benefit-focused messaging. Lead with the problem Echo solves (single-threaded Node.js blocking) followed by the solution (parallel CPU core utilization). Trim detailed architecture tables, usage code examples, and contribution calls-to-action.\n\nReduce README from ~200 lines to ~150 lines while preserving key features, ecosystem context, and development setup info.",
